Apart from the obvious advice (don't try not to level up if it keeps
getting you into trouble), 's'earching for mimics is a bad idea, since when
there is one, it'll now be activated and probably have a free turn, right
next to you. So either spot them out before with telepathy (deactivate ESP
when entering the shop) or similar, or detect them by throwing darts along
the lines of items. When you detect one, flee from the shop, close the
door, wait a few turns and it will go back into hiding. You can tell where
it is because there will be a new item once you get into line of sight
again.

